sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant OGX as OGX Server<br/>8321/TCP HTTP
    participant Auth as Auth Middleware<br/>OAuth2/JWKS
    participant Provider as Inference Provider<br/>(vLLM/Bedrock/WatsonX/...)
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant VectorDB as Vector Backend<br/>(Milvus/pgvector/Qdrant)
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,S3: Inference Request Flow

    Client->>OGX: POST /v1/messages<br/>HTTP 8321/TCP
    alt AUTH_ISSUER configured
        OGX->>Auth: Validate token
        Auth->>Auth: JWKS key validation<br/>(3600s recheck period)
        Auth-->>OGX: Token valid<br/>(owner identity extracted)
    end
    OGX->>Provider: Proxy inference request<br/>(HTTP/HTTPS, provider-specific auth)
    Provider-->>OGX: Inference response
    OGX->>PG: Persist conversation state<br/>SQL 5432/TCP
    PG-->>OGX: Ack
    OGX-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client,S3: Vector Store Flow

    Client->>OGX: POST /vector_io<br/>HTTP 8321/TCP
    OGX->>VectorDB: Vector operation<br/>(HTTP/gRPC, provider-specific)
    VectorDB-->>OGX: Vector result
    OGX->>PG: Persist vector store metadata<br/>sql_default backend
    PG-->>OGX: Ack
    OGX-->>Client: Vector response

    Note over Client,S3: File Storage Flow

    Client->>OGX: POST /files<br/>HTTP 8321/TCP
    OGX->>S3: Store file<br/>HTTPS 443/TCP
    S3-->>OGX: Storage confirmation
    OGX->>PG: Persist file metadata
    PG-->>OGX: Ack
    OGX-->>Client: File reference

    Note over OGX,OGX: Secret Resolution Flow (startup)

    Note right of OGX: entrypoint.sh reads 18<br/>_FILE secret env vars<br/>from K8s-mounted files<br/>before launching ogx run
